{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-1865bd801425ecda9adb","text":"怎么样，拿到碟片了吗","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-626949e19b0320cbf09c","text":"（跟帕姆说讨要碟片的事）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-598af7b65f017434aee5","text":"我去问希露瓦要专辑了，但她那也没有，真可惜","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-91f00c231dacd559e10a","text":"知道啦，我会去「公司」那边问问看能不能订到。不过列车长不能保证这样能否照顾到每个乘客的口味","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e85e231edbd6e260dd2d","text":"你也别灰心了，你是开拓者，行走在外，总会有机会的","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2b7f358a7b066cce2477","text":"何况留声机就在列车上，没有长脚，不会到处跑","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
